<h1 id="librawssg_handler">librawssg_handler</h1>
<p>
   <strong>Version</strong>: 1.0.0 (implied)<br /><strong>Crate name</strong>:
   <code>librawssg_handler</code><br /><strong>Description</strong>: Core data
   structures and traits for building a static site generator (SSG) handler.
   Provides <code>Document</code>, <code>Metadata</code>, and a
   <code>Processor</code> trait for processing content files.
</p>
